# QA-007: Bracket an iodine endpoint with known thiosulfate increments
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KI 0.002mol
add v1 I2 0.0001mol
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.00015mol
measure v1 uvvis
inspect v1
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.00004mol
measure v1 uvvis
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.00001mol
measure v1 uvvis
inspect v1
add v1 Na2S2O3 0.00002mol
inspect
